@startuml
Participant Payer1 as PAYER 
Participant Payee2 as PAYEE 
box "Trusted parties" #LightGreen
Entity "Cert Auth(s)" as CA
Entity NOTARY
end box

== 1: TX creation ==

autonumber 1.1
PAYER -> PAYER: signs tx at time1

note over PAYER: tx contains\nbackchain information

PAYER -> PAYEE: signed Payer1 (time1, tx)

== 2: Counterparty TX Verification ==
autonumber 2.1
PAYEE -> CA: get certs (Payer)
CA --> PAYEE: ret certs


PAYEE -> CA: get CRL
CA --> PAYEE: ret CRL (time2)

PAYEE -> PAYEE: Start verify & sign tx
activate PAYEE

PAYEE -> PAYEE: is past signature valid at timePast1? \n get CRL at time ()


deactivate PAYEE

' PAYEE --> PAYER: signed Bob(signed Payer1 (tx))

== 2: TX Notarization and finality ==

autonumber 3.1

PAYEE -> NOTARY: signed Payee2(time3, signed Payer1 (time1, tx))
NOTARY -> CA: get CRL
CA --> NOTARY: ret CRL (time3.5)


autonumber 4.1
  NOTARY -> PAYER : signed Notary (time4, signed Bob(signed Payer1 (time1, tx)))
 NOTARY -> PAYEE : signed Notary (time4, signed Bob(signed Payer1 (time1, tx)))
@enduml